REAL DOCUMENT EXCLUSIONS
This dedication does not apply to examples/real/** or datasets/real-small/**.
Those authentic government publications and assembled packets retain their
source-specific rights. See examples/real/SOURCE.json and NOTICE.md, and
datasets/real-small/v1/SOURCE.json and NOTICE.md. In particular, co-branded
handouts are not claimed to be wholly public domain or licensed CC0. Official
seals, agency marks and third-party trademarks retain their protections.
The benchmark metadata and code do not grant rights in the original documents.

This dedication also does not apply to bundled fonts, third-party software,
or trademarks. Font licenses are preserved under datasets/assets/fonts.
Generator, verification, and test code use the repository's code license.
